OL,3,GNEWSAStates director who was based in
OL,4,AUK leaves role
OL,5,
OL,6,FA top civil servant in Guernsey has
OL,7,Fleft his role after he was criticised
OL,8,Ffor being based in the UK.
OL,10,FPoliticians had raised concerns that
OL,11,FGary Salter, who was the director of
OL,12,Fpopulation management for the States of
OL,13,FGuernsey, was not living locally.
OL,15,FIn recent months the Population
OL,16,FManagement Office has also faced
OL,17,Fcriticism over a backlog of employment
OL,18,Fpermit applications.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
